  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the snowy pine forest on the edge of town that afternoon. Shaken by the smear campaign alleging his grandfather was a fascist collaborator, Ivan wandered into the woods alone. Intoxicated and distressed, he begins hallucinating and arguing with disembodied voices in the trees before staggering back home. Let's listen to the scene in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "voice",
      "t": "Иван, перестань винить себя во всём!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ты ничего не понимаешь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я предатель и внук фашиста!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "voice",
      "t": "Это неправда! У тебя сегодня важные дебаты.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "В моих генах живёт зло.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здесь в снегу сидят крокодилы!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "voice",
      "t": "Пойдём скорее на телевизионную студию!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Стоять! Кто стреляет в лесу?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Оставьте меня в покое!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "voice",
      "t": "Посмотри вокруг, здесь никого нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "У меня разбита губа и болит голова.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я иду спать на чердак.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Передайте Нине, что я дома.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's go through the scene line by line. First, an imaginary voice echoes through the snowy trees.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "voice",
      "t": "Иван, перестань винить себя во всём!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ivan, stop blaming yourself for everything!' The opening imperative command expresses an urgent plea to cease self-blame.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Ты ничего не понимаешь!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You don't understand anything!' In Russian, double negative structures are standard and grammatically required.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я предатель и внук фашиста!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am a traitor and the grandson of a fascist!' Ivan repeats the painful slander broadcast by his political opponents.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "voice",
      "t": "Это неправда! У тебя сегодня важные дебаты.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is not true! You have an important debate today.' The internal voice reminds him of his public campaign duties.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "В моих генах живёт зло.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Evil lives in my genes.' In his intoxicated state, Ivan believes his moral flaws were inherited from his grandfather.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Здесь в снегу сидят крокодилы!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here in the snow sit crocodiles!' Cold air and heavy drinking cause Ivan to hallucinate wild animals among the trees.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "voice",
      "t": "Пойдём скорее на телевизионную студию!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's go quickly to the television studio!' The urgent phrase pushes him toward the critical live broadcast.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Стоять! Кто стреляет в лесу?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Freeze! Who is shooting in the forest?' In his delirium, Ivan imagines wartime enemies lurking behind the snowy pines.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Оставьте меня в покое!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Leave me alone!' Ivan uses an idiom meaning to go away into the woods and leave him in peace.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "voice",
      "t": "Посмотри вокруг, здесь никого нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Look around, there is no one here.' The hallucination fades as Ivan realizes the quiet forest is completely empty.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "У меня разбита губа и болит голова.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My lip is cut and my head hurts.' Physical discomfort pulls him back toward cold reality.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я иду спать на чердак.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am going to sleep in the attic.' Ivan chooses the dusty communal attic as a hiding place from shame.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Передайте Нине, что я дома.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tell Nina that I am at home.' Even in despair, he thinks of his estranged wife waiting in the apartment. Now let's hear the whole scene once more, from start to finish.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
